{"schemaVersion":2,"kind":"source","source":{"id":"src_43154f5a-b493-41d9-8eea-f69cbb481619","owner":"actor_human","title":"位置编码","text":"[00:05] 学生：为什么 Transformer 需要位置编码？\n[00:12] 老师：因为自注意力本身不区分词的顺序。例如把句子里的词打乱，注意力的输出只是跟着重新排列。\n[00:40] 学生：我明白了。","kind":"dialogue","episodes":[{"id":"src_43154f5a-b493-41d9-8eea-f69cbb481619#e1","span":{"start":0,"end":105},"time":{"from":5,"to":40}}],"addedAt":1793713548841,"reader":"episteme","digest":"a752851d60533cdfd1e6e0598abf7e5803ca90f894b4ff3d632b2150f4fb47d0"}}
